{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Chained Beasts",
    "steam_appid": 3569420,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569420/extras/3c639c1600ff13e1b8e4b70c5ff71eb6.avif?t=1754632123\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569420/extras/1f14f451e4c8cd0d519dadb6e6b7301c.poster.avif?t=1754632123\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569420/extras/1f14f451e4c8cd0d519dadb6e6b7301c.webm?t=1754632123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569420/extras/1f14f451e4c8cd0d519dadb6e6b7301c.mp4?t=1754632123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your weapon, raise your shield and enter the Colosseum alone or with three friends in this chaotic gladiator roguelite. Master swords, spears, maces and flails as you come face to face with rival gladiators while shackled to each other. Endure physical and mental injuries as you perform for the crowd and fight to break your bonds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569420/extras/40891d488b429856bbfd474b12be89f6.avif?t=1754632123\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569420/extras/22ef47e72fd359c290599be333b0da4b.poster.avif?t=1754632123\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569420/extras/22ef47e72fd359c290599be333b0da4b.webm?t=1754632123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569420/extras/22ef47e72fd359c290599be333b0da4b.mp4?t=1754632123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enslaved by the Emperor and cast into the dungeon, you must fight to earn your freedom. This is a blood sport, and the more spectacular your fight, the more the blood-thirsty crowd will be entertained. Catch opponents in your chains to throw them off balance, hurl their bodies at one another, or lure them into deadly spike pits and flamethrowers. Improvise with weapons thrown to you by an adoring crowd, and live long enough to leave them wanting more.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569420/extras/62a006bb938770a5830bb1a053d14592.avif?t=1754632123\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569420/extras/d1304250b569d82c4ee497fab3c3c85a.poster.avif?t=1754632123\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569420/extras/d1304250b569d82c4ee497fab3c3c85a.webm?t=1754632123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569420/extras/d1304250b569d82c4ee497fab3c3c85a.mp4?t=1754632123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heal your wounds and train to become stronger between each battle. But some injuries will leave a permanent mark that will change how you play. A broken leg, a missing eye, and paranoia-induced hallucinations are just some of the dozens of conditions that you and your fellow gladiators may suffer. Spend your coin on upgrades and unlock new beast masks to forge the ultimate gladiator. Fame, freedom and glory await, if you can survive until tomorrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569420/extras/5074ec3057a0b48395b13b0b5d48b027.poster.avif?t=1754632123\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569420/extras/5074ec3057a0b48395b13b0b5d48b027.webm?t=1754632123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569420/extras/5074ec3057a0b48395b13b0b5d48b027.mp4?t=1754632123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569420/extras/3c639c1600ff13e1b8e4b70c5ff71eb6.avif?t=1754632123\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569420/extras/1f14f451e4c8cd0d519dadb6e6b7301c.poster.avif?t=1754632123\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569420/extras/1f14f451e4c8cd0d519dadb6e6b7301c.webm?t=1754632123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569420/extras/1f14f451e4c8cd0d519dadb6e6b7301c.mp4?t=1754632123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your weapon, raise your shield and enter the Colosseum alone or with three friends in this chaotic gladiator roguelite. Master swords, spears, maces and flails as you come face to face with rival gladiators while shackled to each other. Endure physical and mental injuries as you perform for the crowd and fight to break your bonds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569420/extras/40891d488b429856bbfd474b12be89f6.avif?t=1754632123\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569420/extras/22ef47e72fd359c290599be333b0da4b.poster.avif?t=1754632123\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569420/extras/22ef47e72fd359c290599be333b0da4b.webm?t=1754632123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569420/extras/22ef47e72fd359c290599be333b0da4b.mp4?t=1754632123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enslaved by the Emperor and cast into the dungeon, you must fight to earn your freedom. This is a blood sport, and the more spectacular your fight, the more the blood-thirsty crowd will be entertained. Catch opponents in your chains to throw them off balance, hurl their bodies at one another, or lure them into deadly spike pits and flamethrowers. Improvise with weapons thrown to you by an adoring crowd, and live long enough to leave them wanting more.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569420/extras/62a006bb938770a5830bb1a053d14592.avif?t=1754632123\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569420/extras/d1304250b569d82c4ee497fab3c3c85a.poster.avif?t=1754632123\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569420/extras/d1304250b569d82c4ee497fab3c3c85a.webm?t=1754632123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569420/extras/d1304250b569d82c4ee497fab3c3c85a.mp4?t=1754632123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heal your wounds and train to become stronger between each battle. But some injuries will leave a permanent mark that will change how you play. A broken leg, a missing eye, and paranoia-induced hallucinations are just some of the dozens of conditions that you and your fellow gladiators may suffer. Spend your coin on upgrades and unlock new beast masks to forge the ultimate gladiator. Fame, freedom and glory await, if you can survive until tomorrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569420/extras/5074ec3057a0b48395b13b0b5d48b027.poster.avif?t=1754632123\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569420/extras/5074ec3057a0b48395b13b0b5d48b027.webm?t=1754632123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569420/extras/5074ec3057a0b48395b13b0b5d48b027.mp4?t=1754632123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Chained Beasts is a 1-4 player co-op gladiator roguelite. Fight chaotic battles in the Colosseum while chained to your friends. Brave physical and mental injuries that change how you play. Entertain the blood-thirsty crowd by unleashing your inner beast.",
